! Dividuus numbers are integers that are divisible by the sum of their
! digits, the product of their digits, their digital root, and their
! multiplicative digital root.
! 
! Dividuus is Latin for 'divisible'.
! 
! Task
! 
! -   Find and display the first fifty dividuus numbers.
! 
! Stretch
! 
! -   Find and display the dividuus numbers between 990 million and one
!     billion.
! 
! See also
! 
! -   OEIS: A118575 - Dividuus numbers
! -   Task: Digital root
! -   Task: Multiplicative digital root


